  <h2>Understanding Minimum Order Quantities</h2>
  <p>Minimum Order Quantity (MOQ) is the lowest number of units a factory is willing to produce for a single style/color. We offer flexible solutions for all brand sizes.</p>
  
  <h3>MOQ Tiers at Fitclo</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Ready-to-Ship: MOQ 1-50 pcs for quick testing</li>
    <li>Private Label: MOQ 100-200 pcs per style/color</li>
    <li>Full Custom (OEM): MOQ 300+ pcs for unique fabrics</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Why Low MOQ Matters</h3>
  <p>Low MOQs allow you to test market demand, manage inventory risk, and launch a wider variety of designs with less upfront capital.</p>
</GuideLayout>
